Lane? You better...

473
00:53:19.922 --> 00:53:22.091
Myer...

474
00:53:32.434 --> 00:53:35.729
- So you're Al Myer's kid?
- Yes. I am.

475
00:53:35.896 --> 00:53:39.858
- You look pretty stupid to me.
- Thank you.

476
00:53:40.025 --> 00:53:42.861
Let's see if you have any brains.

477
00:53:44.154 --> 00:53:47.533
- You take the meat. Understand?
- Yeah.

478
00:53:47.700 --> 00:53:51.453
- Pat it into pate ball.
- Push it into pate ball.

479
00:53:51.620 --> 00:53:54.248
No. this is a push.

480
00:53:54.415 --> 00:53:56.500
This is a pat.

481
00:53:56.667 --> 00:54:00.212
Take the pate ball
and put it on the tray.

482
00:54:00.379 --> 00:54:04.591
Put on this hat.
You see that sign out there?

483
00:54:04.758 --> 00:54:07.636
You wear it with pride. Put it on!

484
00:54:10.472 --> 00:54:12.558
Ow!

485
00:54:14.101 --> 00:54:18.772
You gotta have pride and class
in this business. You understand?

486
00:54:22.484 --> 00:54:25.404
- What's that?
- Those are the keys.

487
00:54:25.571 --> 00:54:28.949
I want you here
6 a.m. Saturday morning.

488
00:54:29.116 --> 00:54:33.287
This place has to be swept
before the breakfast crew get here.

489
00:54:33.454 --> 00:54:35.539
Roger.

490
00:54:37.416 --> 00:54:40.336
- Where you going?
- To wash my hands.

491
00:54:40.502 --> 00:54:44.465
- Wash your hands on your own time!
- Yes. sir.

492
00:54:46.717 --> 00:54:48.802
- Fat pig!
- What?

493
00:54:48.969 --> 00:54:51.055
Pat pig.

494
00:55:10.866 --> 00:55:12.951
Everybody wants some!

495
00:55:18.248 --> 00:55:21.251
I'll show you what everybody wants!

496
00:55:21.960 --> 00:55:24.546
(THUNDERCLAP)

497
00:55:26.590 --> 00:55:28.676
Mad! Mad! Me. a fool!

498
00:55:28.842 --> 00:55:31.387
