499
00:56:19.435 --> 00:56:21.520
It's alive!

500
00:56:29.403 --> 00:56:31.321
<i># Oh. yeah!</i>

501
00:56:33.657 --> 00:56:36.160
<i># Oh. yeah!</i>

502
00:56:40.289 --> 00:56:45.127
<i># You can't get romantic</i>
<i>on a subway line</i>

503
00:56:47.212 --> 00:56:51.717
<i># Conductor don't like it</i>
<i>Says you're wasting your time</i>

504
00:56:52.885 --> 00:56:55.804
<i># But everybody wants some</i>

505
00:56:55.971 --> 00:56:58.057
<i># I want some too</i>

506
00:56:59.933 --> 00:57:05.147
<i># Everybody wants some</i>
<i>Baby. how about you?</i>

507
00:57:07.566 --> 00:57:11.820
<i># I took a mobile light</i>
