508
00:57:13.906 --> 00:57:18.243
<i># Yeah. you stand in line</i>
<i>You got lost in a jet-stream</i>

509
00:57:19.745 --> 00:57:24.166
<i># But everybody wants some</i>
<i>I want some too #

