00:57:44.061 --> 00:57:46.105
Buenos días!

514
00:57:46.271 --> 00:57:49.525
(SNORTS LIKE A PIG)

515
00:57:49.983 --> 00:57:54.154
Looking really good today. buddy.
Looking real good.

516
00:57:55.990 --> 00:57:57.491
Goon.

517
00:58:05.958 --> 00:58:08.043
All right!

518
00:58:09.545 --> 00:58:11.630
This is it!

519
00:58:12.047 --> 00:58:14.591
Whaaa...

520
00:58:16.927 --> 00:58:19.388
Whoa...! Ah!

