- <i>I can't tell you.</i>

524
00:58:50.794 --> 00:58:55.632
<i>Lane. I know this is awkward.</i>
<i>me being a cartoon and all.</i>

525
00:58:55.799 --> 00:59:00.095
<i>I was just wondering</i>
<i>how you'd feel if I took out Beth.</i>

526
00:59:25.913 --> 00:59:30.668
