I'm telling my mom.

575
01:04:18.163 --> 01:04:20.541
(CLANKING)

576
01:04:27.256 --> 01:04:29.341
See you later.

577
01:04:30.884 --> 01:04:35.055
Ever since I got my licence.
they've been after me.

578
01:04:35.222 --> 01:04:40.227
If I had my Camaro running.
I would blow those boys off the street!

579
