She cooks all the time.
It's a lot better than it used to be.

585
01:05:35.741 --> 01:05:37.826
Buenos días!

586
01:05:38.827 --> 01:05:42.706
Bonjour. Voulez-vous couchez
avec moi ce soir?

587
