All you gotta do to be captain.
Myer. is beat me.

589
01:05:53.592 --> 01:05:58.263
The try-outs won't be the same
if you're not there... champ.

590
01:06:01.100 --> 01:06:06.522
So. are you and Myer talking about
what a great lover he is?

591
01:06:06.689 --> 01:06:11.443
She only speaks French. Roy.
She doesn't speak imbecile.

592
01:06:11.610 --> 01:06:17.491
Myer. there's one language that
I speak that all women understand.

593
01:06:17.658 --> 01:06:20.244
Just ask your last girlfriend.

594
01:06:20.411 --> 01:06:23.706
Would you like to learn
some new words?

595
01:06:23.872 --> 01:06:27.835
- Shit! Stupid!
- Pardonne-moi! Je suis stupide!

596
01:06:28.002 --> 01:06:30.421
- What's going on?
- Nothing!

597
01:06:30.587 --> 01:06:34.383
Myer's frog girlfriend
is as much of a clod as he is!

598
01:06:34.550 --> 01:06:40.264
You think you're such a tough guy!
I could out-ski you any day!

599
01:06:40.431 --> 01:06:44.059
- Really?
- You want a race. I'll take you on.

600
01:06:44.226 --> 01:06:47.354
- Sure.
- From the K-12. champ!

601
01:06:47.521 --> 01:06:49.064
Chicken!

602
01:06:49.231 --> 01:06:52.067
- What did you say?
- Any time. you name it.

603
01:06:52.234 --> 01:06:56.113
- You're digging your own grave.
- No one has to know.

604
01:06:56.280 --> 01:06:59.616
- Just me and you.
- Sunday. high noon.

605
01:06:59.783 --> 01:07:02.036
You're on.

606
01:07:06.790 --> 01:07:08.667
<i>(PA) This just in!</i>

607
01:07:08.834 --> 01:07:14.048
<i>Lane Myer will be racing Roy Stalin</i>
<i>down K- 12 this Sunday at 12 noon.</i>

608
01:07:14.214 --> 01:07:17.217
