609
01:07:22.639 --> 01:07:26.769
I must be brain-damaged.
I'm gonna race. lose and die.

610
01:07:26.935 --> 01:07:30.064
Est-ce que la voiture ne marche pas?

611
01:07:30.230 --> 01:07:32.316
