You might find a nice friend.

658
01:12:00.125 --> 01:12:02.711
You do have friends in France?

659
01:12:02.878 --> 01:12:08.092
You know. friend! Friend!

660
01:12:11.929 --> 01:12:15.557
- You will not tell?
- That you're a Dodgers fan?

661
01:12:15.724 --> 01:12:19.937
